      "headline": "Howard Jones: 39 Years of Shows",
      "prose": "I first caught Howard Jones at Irvine Meadows in 1985, right in the thick of his \"Dream Into Action\" era when those synthesizer hooks were everywhere. What strikes me now is how I kept coming back — six shows across 39 years, from that outdoor amphitheater in Orange County to the YouTube Theatre in Inglewood just this past August. There's something about his earnest optimism and those unmistakable keyboard melodies that pulls me back decade after decade. I suppose some artists just become part of your personal soundtrack, whether you plan it or not.",
